                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.6363/593: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Summerlin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-09T11:00:00-06:36"><hi rendition="#italic">December 9,
                                1919, 11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 7.24
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>3354. Executive petroleum bill passed Mexican Senate yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summerlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
